  "content_html": "<div id=\"main\">\n\t\t<section id=\"primary\">\n\t\t\t<div id=\"profile\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"cover\" style=\"background-image: url();\"><div class=\"scores\"><span class=\"score-label\">累積人氣<span class=\"score\">344</span></span><span class=\"score-label\">累積讚數<span class=\"score\">86</span></span><span class=\"score-label\">台客獎章<span class=\"score\">4</span></span></div></div><div class=\"author-info\"><img src=\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/6f403ab28e9d72e6e6d2b928b98d8374?d=http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/wp-content/plugins/avatar/mystery-man.jpg&amp;s=150\" alt=\"\" class=\"avatar user-127-avatar\" width='150' height='150' /><h2 class=\"name-title\">Sean Lin</h2><h3 class=\"description\"></h3><div class=\"bio\"></div></div>\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<hr>\n\t\t\t<h2>Sean Lin 發表的文章</h2>\n\t\t\t<div id=\"content\" role=\"main\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"article-div divider\">\t\t\t\t\n<article id=\"post-5750\" class=\"post-5750 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-b2g\">\n\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"https://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/5750/%e6%b7%ba%e8%ab%87-system-message\" title=\"Permalink to 淺談 System Message\" rel=\"bookmark\">淺談 System Message</a></h2>\n    <p class=\"entry-posted\">\n      <time datetime=\"2014-05-14T10:01:17+00:00\" title=\"2014-05-14T10:01:17+00:00\" class=\"published\">\n        <a title=\"See all posts from May, 2014\" href=\"https://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/date/2015/01\" class=\"posted-month\">1月</a>\n        <span class=\"posted-date\">12</span>\n        <a title=\"See all posts from 2014\" href=\"https://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/date/2015\" class=\"posted-year\">2015</a>\n      </time>\n    </p>\n      \t\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-meta\">\n      <div class=\"author-meta\" data-author-id=\"127\">\n        <a href=\"https://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/author/selinmozilla-com\">\n          <img src=\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/6f403ab28e9d72e6e6d2b928b98d8374?d=http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/wp-content/plugins/avatar/mystery-man.jpg&amp;s=24\" alt=\"\" class=\"avatar user-127-avatar\" width='24' height='24' /><!--\n       --><div class=\"author-info\">Sean Lin</div><!--\n       --><div class=\"author-title\"></div>\n        </a>\n        </div>\n      </div><!-- .entry-meta -->\n\t\t\t</header><!-- .entry-header -->\n\n\n\t<div class=\"thumb-img\"><img src=\"https://tech.mozilla.com.tw/wp-content/uploads/2014/11/SystemMessage_SendMessage-150x150.png\"/></div>\t<div class=\"entry-content half\">\n\t\t相信各位使用手機或多或少都有收過 SMS 簡訊或是定時鬧鈴等種種來自系統本身的通知，而在 Firefox OS 中，這些功能都可透過所謂的 system message 機制來達成，即便是在相關 app 尚未開啟的情況下。\r\n\r\n簡而言之，system message 是為了處理一些必須要由 Gecko 來掌控並提供給相關 Gaia app 的訊息而衍伸出來的機制。在某些情況下，相關的 app 可.....<a class=\"more\" href=\"https://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/5750/%e6%b7%ba%e8%ab%87-system-message\">深入了解</a>  \n\t</div><!-- .entry-content -->\n\t\n  <footer class=\"entry-footer\">\n            <div class=\"entry-category-box\">\n      文章分類：\n      <a href=\"https://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/category/b2g\" rel=\"category tag\">Firefox OS(B2G)</a>    </div>\n        <div class=\"entry-social-box\">\n      社群分享：\n     <div class=\"fb-like\" data-href=\"https://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/5750/%e6%b7%ba%e8%ab%87-system-message\" data-layout=\"button_count\" data-width=\"40\" data-show-faces=\"false\" data-font=\"arial\"></div>     <!-- Place this tag where you want the +1 button to render. -->\n     \n     <div class=\"google-share\"><div class=\"g-plusone\" name=\"gplus\" data-size=\"medium\" data-annotation=\"bubble\" data-width=\"40\" data-href=\"https://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/5750/%e6%b7%ba%e8%ab%87-system-message\"></div></div>     \n    <div class=\"pinterest-share\"><a href=\"http://pinterest.com/pin/create/button/?url=https://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/5750/%e6%b7%ba%e8%ab%87-system-message&media=https://tech.mozilla.com.tw/wp-content/up